      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I also agree with this request.\n\nI often use the “Microphone ON/OFF”, “Mirror Grabbable” and “Nameplates Visibility” options in the Action Menu, but I find it inconvenient that I have to go up and down the Action Menu hierarchy each time I want to use them.\n\nIn addition, when the Action Menu is used a lot, the number of times the controller's stick is operated also inevitably increases, and this is thought to be one of the causes of the controller's stick drifting.\n\nThe Tools customization function is a great way to solve these problems.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
